      "docs": "This kit uses StyleX, not Tailwind utilities. The consumer app must compile StyleX (`@stylexjs/stylex` plus a bundler plugin such as `@stylexjs/unplugin` or `@stylexjs/babel-plugin`). Initializing Tailwind is not enough.",
